{"seq":3,"slug":"quantum-signal","title":"量子力学与信号应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/applications/quantum-signal","wordCount":1598,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"量子力学与信号应用\">量子力学与信号应用</h1><p>泛函分析最戏剧性的成功，是它先于物理需求被发明，又恰好成为量子力学量身定制的语言。希尔伯特空间装态、自伴算子装可观测量、谱装测量值、酉算子装演化——量子公理几乎是泛函分析词典的直接翻译。同一套数学还撑起了信号处理与现代机器学习的核方法。本节把前面所有抽象工具收束到这三个高密度应用场景，展示「空间—算子—对偶与谱」三条主线如何在真实问题里汇合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量子力学的数学骨架是一组对应关系：系统的状态是可分希尔伯特空间里的单位向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\psi\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>（见<a href=\"../spaces/inner-product-hilbert\">内积与希尔伯特空间</a>）；每个可观测量是一个自伴算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>；测量的可能结果是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的谱 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（见<a href=\"../duality-spectrum/spectral-theory\">谱理论</a>）；测得某结果的概率由态在对应谱投影上的投影长度给出。自伴性保证谱为实数，正对应「测量值必须是实数」这一物理要求——数学约束与物理事实严丝合缝。</p>\n<p>时间演化由薛定谔方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i\\hbar\\, \\partial_t|\\psi\\rangle = H|\\psi\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\">ℏ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 给出，其解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>ψ</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\psi(t)\\rangle = e^{-iHt/\\hbar}|\\psi_0\\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⟩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-iHt/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是由哈密顿算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 经函数演算生成的酉算子。酉性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>ψ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\||\\psi(t)\\rangle\\|=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">ψ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)⟩</span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 恒成立，即概率守恒。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;物理概念&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;数学对象&quot;]&#10;  C[&quot;量子态&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;希尔伯特空间单位向量 |ψ⟩&quot;]&#10;  E[&quot;可观测量&quot;] --&gt; F[&quot;自伴算子 A,谱为实&quot;]&#10;  G[&quot;测量结果&quot;] --&gt; H[&quot;谱 σ(A) 中的值&quot;]&#10;  I[&quot;测量概率&quot;] --&gt; J[&quot;到谱投影的投影长度&quot;]&#10;  K[&quot;时间演化&quot;] --&gt; L[&quot;酉算子 e^{−iHt/ℏ}&quot;]&#10;  M[&quot;概率守恒&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;酉性 ‖ψ(t)‖=1&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; O[&quot;叠加=向量线性组合&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"物理概念\"] --&gt; B[\"数学对象\"]\n  C[\"量子态\"] --&gt; D[\"希尔伯特空间单位向量 |ψ⟩\"]\n  E[\"可观测量\"] --&gt; F[\"自伴算子 A,谱为实\"]\n  G[\"测量结果\"] --&gt; H[\"谱 σ(A) 中的值\"]\n  I[\"测量概率\"] --&gt; J[\"到谱投影的投影长度\"]\n  K[\"时间演化\"] --&gt; L[\"酉算子 e^{−iHt/ℏ}\"]\n  M[\"概率守恒\"] --&gt; N[\"酉性 ‖ψ(t)‖=1\"]\n  D --&gt; O[\"叠加=向量线性组合\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>物理概念</th>\n<th>泛函分析对象</th>\n<th>关键性质</th>\n<th>出处章节</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>希尔伯特空间单位向量</td>\n<td>可叠加（线性）</td>\n<td>内积与希尔伯特空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可观测量</td>\n<td>自伴算子</td>\n<td>谱为实数</td>\n<td>有界线性算子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测量值</td>\n<td>算子的谱</td>\n<td>点谱=离散能级</td>\n<td>谱理论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演化</td>\n<td>酉算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{-iHt/\\hbar}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/ℏ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>保范、概率守恒</td>\n<td>谱定理函数演算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定性</td>\n<td>算子不可交换</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[A,B]\\neq 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>算子代数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"不确定性原理-算子不对易的几何\">不确定性原理：算子不对易的几何</h2><p>海森堡不确定性原理在泛函分析里有一个干净的代数来源：位置算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与动量算子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不对易，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\hat x, \\hat p] = \\hat x\\hat p - \\hat p\\hat x = i\\hbar I</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6889em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord\">ℏ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span></span></span></span></span>。由柯西-施瓦茨不等式（见<a href=\"../spaces/inner-product-hilbert\">内积与希尔伯特空间</a>）可严格推出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℏ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta x \\cdot \\Delta p \\ge \\hbar/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℏ/2</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是标准差。</p>\n<p>这说明不确定性不是测量技术的局限，而是「两个不对易自伴算子无法同时拥有共同特征向量」的纯数学事实。它与谱理论紧密相连：若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A, B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 对易，谱定理保证它们可被同一组谱投影同时对角化（同时可测）；不对易则这种共同基不存在。位置与动量都是无界自伴算子，位置算子的谱是连续谱（粒子可在任意位置）、束缚态哈密顿量的谱是点谱（能级离散）——点谱与连续谱之分（见<a href=\"../duality-spectrum/spectral-theory\">谱理论</a>）正对应束缚态与散射态的物理区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"信号处理-傅里叶-采样与时频权衡\">信号处理：傅里叶、采样与时频权衡</h2><p>信号处理是同一套希尔伯特空间几何的另一副面孔。信号是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里的向量，傅里叶变换是把它换到频率正交基下的酉算子（见<a href=\"hilbert-orthonormal\">希尔伯特空间与正交基</a>），帕塞瓦尔等式在这里叫帕塞瓦尔-普朗谢雷尔定理，断言时域能量等于频域能量——变换不损失也不放大信息。滤波是乘法算子，卷积经傅里叶变换化为逐点相乘，这把求解时不变系统从积分降为代数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号操作</th>\n<th>算子类型</th>\n<th>泛函分析事实</th>\n<th>工程后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>傅里叶变换</td>\n<td>酉算子</td>\n<td>保范（普朗谢雷尔）</td>\n<td>能量守恒、可逆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滤波</td>\n<td>乘法算子</td>\n<td>谱上逐点缩放</td>\n<td>选频、去噪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卷积</td>\n<td>与平移对易</td>\n<td>傅里叶下变乘法</td>\n<td>快速算法 FFT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采样重建</td>\n<td>投影到带限子空间</td>\n<td>香农定理</td>\n<td>无失真离散化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时频不确定性（Gabor 极限）与量子不确定性是同一条数学定理的两种叫法：一个信号不能同时在时间和频率上都任意局部化。这正是小波与短时傅里叶变换权衡的根源——它们在「时间分辨率」与「频率分辨率」之间选择折中，对应于在不同正交基/框架（见<a href=\"hilbert-orthonormal\">希尔伯特空间与正交基</a>）下观察同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 向量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核方法与量子机器学习-无穷维特征空间\">核方法与量子机器学习：无穷维特征空间</h2><p>泛函分析在 2026 年仍活跃于机器学习前沿。核方法把数据 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 映入再生核希尔伯特空间（RKHS）的特征向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϕ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在那里学一个线性模型；表示定理保证最优解可写成核函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k(\\cdot, x_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">⋅</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的有限线性组合，从而把无穷维优化压回有限维（见<a href=\"hilbert-orthonormal\">希尔伯特空间与正交基</a>对框架与 RKHS 的引入）。这套理论让 SVM、高斯过程在无穷维特征空间里仍可计算。</p>\n<p>量子机器学习把这一思路推到极致：量子线路把经典输入编码进量子态构成的特征希尔伯特空间，「量子核」对应态之间的内积，学习仍是 RKHS 里的线性模型。研究指出，线性量子模型的家族可由 RKHS 精确刻画，且表示定理把训练简化为有限维优化（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2110.13162\">Quantum machine learning beyond kernel methods, arXiv:2110.13162</a>；<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1803.07128\">Quantum machine learning in feature Hilbert spaces, arXiv:1803.07128</a>）。RKHS 的算子值与巴拿赫推广进一步把这套框架扩展到反问题、强化学习与动力系统（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.08443\">arXiv:2106.08443</a>）。一百年前为量子力学打磨的希尔伯特空间工具，如今又成了量子计算时代机器学习的脚手架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>量子力学是泛函分析的直接翻译：态=希尔伯特向量、可观测量=自伴算子、测量值=谱、演化=酉算子。</li>\n<li>自伴性保证测量值为实，酉性保证概率守恒，这些物理要求与数学性质严丝合缝。</li>\n<li>不确定性原理源自位置与动量算子不对易，由柯西-施瓦茨推出，对应「不对易算子无共同特征基」。</li>\n<li>信号处理用同一套几何：傅里叶是酉算子、滤波是乘法算子，时频不确定性与量子不确定性是同一定理。</li>\n<li>核方法与量子机器学习在再生核希尔伯特空间里学线性模型，表示定理把无穷维优化压回有限维，是泛函分析的 2026 前沿应用。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量子力学与信号应用","id":"量子力学与信号应用"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"不确定性原理：算子不对易的几何","id":"不确定性原理-算子不对易的几何"},{"level":2,"text":"信号处理：傅里叶、采样与时频权衡","id":"信号处理-傅里叶-采样与时频权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"核方法与量子机器学习：无穷维特征空间","id":"核方法与量子机器学习-无穷维特征空间"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"算子与微分方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/functional-analysis/applications/operators-pde"},"next":null}